@page "/storm-damage-roof-repair-charlotte-nc"
@{
    ViewData["Lang"] = "en";
    ViewData["SeoEn"] = "/storm-damage-roof-repair-charlotte-nc";
    ViewData["SeoEs"] = "/es/reparacion-techo-por-tormenta-charlotte-nc";
}
<main class="resource-site" lang="en">
    @await Html.PartialAsync("_SeoIntentHeader")
    <section class="resource-hero area-charlotte">
        <div class="site-shell">
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Storm damage roof repair Charlotte NC</p>
            <h1>Storm-Damage Roof Repair in Charlotte, NC</h1>
            <p>Hail, wind and tree impacts leave different patterns. Majestic inspects the roof system, records visible conditions and explains repair versus replacement. Your insurer decides coverage. We do not sell a storm claim.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a class="button button-gold" href="/roof-insurance-claim-charlotte-nc">Claim documentation</a>
                <a class="button button-ghost" href="/free-roof-inspection-charlotte-nc">Free storm inspection</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="resource-body section" id="process">
        <div class="site-shell resource-sections">
            <article><span>01</span><div>
                <h2>Hail, wind and tree—different repairs</h2>
                <p>Use the detailed guides: <a class="official-link" href="/hail-damage-roof-inspection-charlotte-nc">hail inspection</a>, <a class="official-link" href="/wind-missing-shingles-repair-charlotte-nc">wind and missing shingles</a>, <a class="official-link" href="/tree-roof-damage-charlotte-nc">tree impact</a>. This page is the hub when you searched “storm damage roof repair Charlotte NC.”</p>
            </div></article>
            <article><span>02</span><div>
                <h2>After the storm, before the adjuster</h2>
                <p>Photograph openings, save receipts, and avoid unsafe climbing. File the claim with your carrier. Majestic can attend a scheduled adjuster visit when you authorize it. Read <a class="official-link" href="/roof-claim-process">the claim process</a>.</p>
            </div></article>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="faq-section section" id="faq">
        <div class="site-shell faq-layout">
            <div><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2>Storm repair questions</h2></div>
            <div class="faq-list">
                <details><summary>Does insurance cover hail damage to a roof?<span>+</span></summary><p>Often hail is a covered peril, but age, wear and policy language still matter. Majestic documents what is visible. The carrier decides.</p></details>
                <details><summary>Does insurance cover wind damage to a roof?<span>+</span></summary><p>Wind may be covered, sometimes with a separate deductible. Cosmetic versus functional damage is a carrier question. We record lifted, creased or missing shingles without promising payment.</p></details>
                <details><summary>How soon should I file a roof claim after a storm?<span>+</span></summary><p>Sooner is usually better for documentation and policy deadlines. Confirm the date of loss with your carrier. NC DOI publishes consumer claim guidance.</p></details>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    @await Html.PartialAsync("_SeoIntentFooter")
</main>
